.TH BTX-MODELCHECK 1 "September 2026" "BTX 0.34.7" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
btx-modelcheck \- static model qualification
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B btx-modelcheck
.I file
.SH DESCRIPTION
Header-only SafeTensors/GGUF structure check. Does not load the whole file
into RAM, does not execute pickle/.pt/Python/.so, and does not launch CUDA.
.PP
A STRUCTURE_VERIFIED result is not a claim of usefulness, safety, or
alignment.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR btx-modeld (1),
.I doc/modelnet/README.md
